  <h2>Small enough for the machine, big enough for the site</h2>
  <p>The same code runs from a Raspberry Pi beside one machine to a Gateway that runs the whole site, with fleet management, multi-site roll-ups, and scheduled reports. It installs with Helm or Podman Quadlet and follows the stable release on its own.</p>
